# 🚀 High-Performance Python Web Server

[![Python 3.8+](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.8+-blue.svg)](https://www.python.org/downloads/)
[![Performance](https://img.shields.io/badge/performance-100K+%20RPS-brightgreen.svg)]()
