## 🚀 Installation

### Requirements

- **Python 3.8+** (3.11+ recommended for best performance)
- **Linux/macOS/Windows** (Linux recommended for production)
- **Optional**: uvloop (2-4× faster event loop on Linux/macOS)

### Basic Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/high-perf-python-server.git
cd high-perf-python-server

# No dependencies required for basic usage!
python optimized_server.py
```

### Performance Installation (Recommended)

```bash
# Install uvloop for 2-4× faster event loop (Linux/macOS only)
pip install uvloop

# Windows users: Install pywin32 for TransmitFile() support
pip install pywin32  # Windows only
```

### System Tuning (For 100K+ RPS)

```bash
# Increase file descriptor limit
ulimit -n 65535

# Apply kernel tuning (Linux)
sudo sysctl -w net.core.somaxconn=4096
sudo sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_max_syn_backlog=8192
sudo sysctl -w net.ipv4.ip_local_port_range="1024 65535"
sudo sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_tw_reuse=1

# Make permanent (add to /etc/sysctl.conf)
echo "net.core.somaxconn = 4096" | sudo tee -a /etc/sysctl.conf
echo "net.ipv4.tcp_max_syn_backlog = 8192" | sudo tee -a /etc/sysctl.conf
echo "net.ipv4.ip_local_port_range = 1024 65535" | sudo tee -a /etc/sysctl.conf
echo "net.ipv4.tcp_tw_reuse = 1" | sudo tee -a /etc/sysctl.conf
```

