## 🎯 Quick Start

### 1. Create Static Directory

```bash
mkdir -p static
echo "<h1>Hello, World!</h1>" > static/index.html
echo "<h1>Test Page</h1>" > static/test.html
```

### 2. Run Server

```bash
python optimized_server.py
```

**Output:**
```
