║                                                                   ║
╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
                      ARCHITECTURE & OPTIMIZATIONS                     
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

EVENT-DRIVEN I/O:
  ✓ epoll / kqueue
  ✓ uvloop (2-4x faster)

CONNECTION POOL (OPTIMIZED):
  ✓ 2000 slots/worker (increased from 1000)
  ✓ Total: 16,000 concurrent
  ✓ Handles burst traffic better

✓ Worker 0: Pool initialized (2000 slots)
✓ Worker 1: Pool initialized (2000 slots)
...
✓ Listening on 0.0.0.0:8080
```

### 3. Test Endpoints

```bash
