## 📈 Comparison with Other Servers

| Server | RPS | Latency (p99) | Memory | Language | Notes |
|--------|-----|---------------|--------|----------|-------|
| **This Server** | **120K** | **28ms** | **450MB** | Python | Async, multi-process |
| nginx | 150K | 15ms | 50MB | C | Highly optimized C code |
| Node.js (Express) | 40K | 45ms | 800MB | JavaScript | Single-threaded |
| Go (net/http) | 180K | 12ms | 200MB | Go | Native concurrency |
| Python (Flask+gunicorn) | 5K | 200ms | 2GB | Python | Thread-per-request |
| Python (FastAPI+uvicorn) | 60K | 35ms | 600MB | Python | Single-process async |

*Benchmarks on 8-core CPU, simple JSON responses*

